{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Peter's Dating Misadventures", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Reminiscing", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 8, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Exchange information about people's interests and backgrounds using a wider range of language.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn8le08ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " The Past Perfect Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Past Perfect tense to identify and talk about an 'earlier past'.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you are talking about a past event, you can refer to something that happened at an earlier time to that past event by using the <span class=\"underline\">Past Perfect </span>tense.<br /><br />  The structure of the Past Perfect is:<br /><br />  Subject + had + past participle<br /><br />  <span class=\"italic\">A colleague of mine<span class=\"strong\"> had fallen off </span>his bike the week before I did.</span><br /> Which event happened<span class=\"italic\"> first</span>? A colleague fell off his bike.<br /> Which event happened<span class=\"italic\"> later</span>? I fell off my bike.<br /><br />  You use the Past Perfect tense (not Simple Past) when you want to talk about how long something had continued <span class=\"strong\">up to a past moment</span>. <br /> Example:<br /> <span class=\"italic\">I hadn't realized how good it was for relieving stress until I started going to the gym every day.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " I had thought about calling you a couple of days before I met Cathy again. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": " I had thought of joining you guys for a game a few months ago, just before I injured my hamstring in a bike accident. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Modals for Possibility and Certainty ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use modals to talk about degrees of certainty.<br /><br /> You use them to describe what is definite, probable, possible, or impossible from the speaker's point of view. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"italic\">must, may, might</span>, and <span class=\"italic\">could</span> to describe degrees of certainty.<br /> You can use modals with the Present Perfect to talk about the possibility of a past event that is not clear in the present context.<br /> Example:<br /> <span class=\"italic\">It must have hurt.</span><br /><br />  Must = it's very likely <br /> Must not / Could not / Can't = it's not possible<br /> May / Might / Can / Could = it's possible<br /> May not / Might not = it's possible this is not true", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">  Modal </span> </div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">  Meaning  </span> </div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">   It must have hurt!  </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" It's very likely that it hurts.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">  You could definitely get back in shape.  </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" It's possible for you to get back in shape.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">  He may not be able to walk properly for a while ...  </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" It's not likely that he can walk properly for a while.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "out of shape", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in bad physical condition", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You're making me feel out of shape, that's all.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le08ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you hear or use when talking about physical activities.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to tear ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to pull apart or into pieces by force", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm afraid I might tear a muscle!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le08ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "hamstring ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a tendon behind your knee", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I injured my hamstring in a bike accident.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le08ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to release", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to liberate something or someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It releases chemicals in the brain, which is what makes you feel happy.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le08ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to relieve", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to free from pain, anxiety, or distress", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I hadn't realized how good it was for relieving stress.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le08ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "endorphins ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "natural painkillers liberated by the body when performing physical activity", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Physical activity releases endorphins in the brain.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le08ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Interview 8 to 10 people about the way they relieve stress.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For each person, ask a few questions about the activity they chose, how often they practice it, and whether it is always effective.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a report (8-10 lines) about your findings. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present your report to a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Listen to your partner's report and discuss the differences and similarities.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I identify activities to relieve stress.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about certainty and possibility.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss differences and similarities with my partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn8le08ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn8le08ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tLook at the time! Do you think Cathy may have forgotten you guys had a date?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Matt</span>:\t\tCathy must be on her way. She may be late because of rush hour, though. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tI'm not complaining. It's good to catch up after so long. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Matt</span>:\t\tFor sure! I had thought about calling you a couple of days before I met Cathy again. I must have forgotten to. I've been spending most of my evenings at the gym lately! <br />"}, {"image": "engenn8le08ob03re2img01.jpg", "time": "20950", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tThat's alright, buddy. You're making me feel out of shape, that's all. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Matt</span>:\t\tYou could definitely get back in shape in no time if you stick around with us!\t<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tI'm afraid I might tear a muscle! I had thought of joining you guys for a game a few months ago, just before I injured my hamstring in a bike accident. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Matt</span>:\t\tOh yeah! I remember that. It took you a few weeks to heal completely. It must have hurt!<br />"}, {"image": "engenn8le08ob03re2img01.jpg", "time": "43000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tIt wasn't that bad, actually. A colleague of mine had fallen off his bike the week before I did, and he broke both his ankles! The doctors told him that he may not be able to walk properly for a while ...<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Matt</span>:\t\tThat's too bad. I certainly wouldn't know what to do without regular physical activity. I hadn't realized how good it was for relieving stress until I started going to the gym every day.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tI know. It releases endorphins in the brain, which is what makes you feel happy. I could definitely use some of those at the moment!<br />"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le08ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le08ob03re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about socializing.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about life experiences. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express possibility or certainty.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What do you like to do to relieve stress? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you think that practicing a sport is a good way to make friends? Why or why not?", "type": "Free 